N0 frame null/orthonormal, and the Ricci coefficients: PASS {'chi': True, 'chib': True, 'omega': True, 'omegab': True,
    'zeta': True, 'eta': True, 'etab': True}
   chi = e^-w c_v, chib = e^-w (c_u + b c_x + b_x), omega = -e^-w w_v/2, omegab = -e^-w (w_u + b w_x)/2,
   zeta = -e^{c-2w} b_v/4, eta = zeta + e^-c w_x, etab = -zeta + e^-c w_x.  b_x appears in chib only.
   (3 s) Ricci ...
